<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Build manufacturing benches and efficient work center.-->
  <VFE_Manufacturing.description>建造制造工作台和高效的工作中心。</VFE_Manufacturing.description>
  <VFE_Manufacturing.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the dawn of industry-->
    <li>subject-&gt;工业的曙光</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pioneered the integration of complex machinery for mass production, heralding a new era of efficiency-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开创了复杂机械集成大规模生产的先河，预示着效率的新时代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->transformed raw materials into marvels of utility, fueling the expansion of civilization-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将原材料转化为实用奇迹，推动文明扩张</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->devised systems of assembly that became the heartbeat of the community's economic engine-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计的装配系统成为社区经济引擎的心跳</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->cultivated a culture of innovation, where every tool and machine is a step towards the future-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;培育了创新文化，每一件工具和机器都是迈向未来的一步</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->founded the principles of modern manufacturing, blending craftsmanship with the precision of technology-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创立了现代制造的原则，将工艺与技术的精确性融为一体</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->carving the path towards a self-sustaining society with the power of industrial manufacturing-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;以工业制造的力量开辟通往自给自足社会的道路</li>
  </VFE_Manufacturing.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: Manufacturing-->
  <VFE_Manufacturing.label>制造业</VFE_Manufacturing.label>
</LanguageData>
